---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Editorial Guidelines Policy | Outfit Edits";
const pageDescription = "How Outfit Edits researches, writes, and reviews its fashion and styling content.";
const lastUpdated = "July 1, 2026";
---

<Layout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Editorial Guidelines Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-6">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p>
        Outfit Edits is committed to publishing outfit ideas, style guides,
        and fashion content that readers can trust and actually use. This
        policy outlines how our content is created, reviewed, and
        maintained.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">How We Create Content</h2>
      <p>
        Every article on Outfit Edits is built around a practical styling
        question: how to wear a specific piece, put together an outfit for
        an occasion, or approach a seasonal trend. Our writers research
        current fashion trends, wardrobe staples, and styling techniques
        before drafting any guide.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Accuracy and Review</h2>
      <p>
        Articles are reviewed for accuracy, clarity, and usefulness before
        publishing. We aim to describe outfits, garments, and styling
        techniques as precisely as possible so readers can recreate the
        looks we cover.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Updates and Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        Fashion trends and seasonal recommendations change. When an article
        becomes outdated, we update it to reflect current styling advice
        rather than leaving stale information live. If you notice an error
        in one of our articles, you can report it through our
        <a href="/contact" class="underline">Contact Us</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Independence</h2>
      <p>
        Outfit Edits' editorial recommendations are based on our own
        styling judgment and research. Any sponsored content, affiliate
        links, or partnerships will be clearly disclosed within the
        relevant article.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3">Sourcing Images</h2>
      <p>
        Visuals used across our articles are created or sourced to
        represent the styling ideas described in the text as closely as
        possible. We do not knowingly use images in a way that
        misrepresents a product or outfit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
